//     IEEE traffic-sign paper, or a separate research effort during MANIT.
//     I've written it as a separate agentic-NLP project given your
//     supporting-work tag is "#transformers #pytorch #transferlearning".
//   - Source URL — paste when ready.
//   - Specific transformer model used (BERT? DistilBERT? RoBERTa?).
//   - The IEEE publication link (if relevant) — your resume has it.
